VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DawsonIntro::
    .string "Beyond here is\n"
    .string "the Elite Four.\p"
    .string "Beyond them is\n"
    .string "something else.\p"
    .string "I've heard things\n"
    .string "from trainers who\p"
    .string "made it back.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DawsonDefeat::
    .string "You'll see for yourself.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DawsonPostBattle::
    .string "Not everything they\n"
    .string "saw had a name.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DaisukeIntro::
    .string "This is Victory Road.\n"
    .string "The final test.\p"
    .string "Some tests reveal\n"
    .string "what you're made of.\p"
    .string "This one reveals\n"
    .string "what made you.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DaisukeDefeat::
    .string "It made something strong.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_DaisukePostBattle::
    .string "Move the boulders.\p"
    .string "Some paths only\n"
    .string "open when you\p"
    .string "apply force.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_NelsonIntro::
    .string "You challenge the\n"
    .string "Elite Four?\p"
    .string "Someone else came\n"
    .string "through here recently.\p"
    .string "They had the\n"
    .string "same look you do.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_NelsonDefeat::
    .string "The same result too.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_NelsonPostBattle::
    .string "Something follows trainers\n"
    .string "who walk this road.\p"
    .string "I've seen it\n"
    .string "behind them.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_VincentIntro::
    .string "Come on.\p"
    .string "This road doesn't\n"
    .string "wait for hesitation.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_VincentDefeat::
    .string "You didn't hesitate.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_VincentPostBattle::
    .string "You earned the\n"
    .string "right to be\p"
    .string "on Victory Road.\p"
    .string "Don't waste it.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_GregoryIntro::
    .string "Is Victory Road\n"
    .string "too tough?\p"
    .string "Many trainers turn\n"
    .string "back here.\p"
    .string "They feel something\n"
    .string "ahead and decide\p"
    .string "they're not ready.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_GregoryDefeat::
    .string "You're ready.$"

VictoryRoad_2F_Text_GregoryPostBattle::
    .string "Whatever waits ahead\n"
    .string "has been watching\p"
    .string "trainers approach\n"
    .string "for a long time.$"

